      "rows": [
        {
          "dimension": "Smart-contract / key security",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "The Profanity vanity-address tool vulnerability compromised L2 DAI deployer addresses on every chain except Optimism and Arbitrum, demonstrating that key-generation tooling used across multiple L2 deployments can create systemic, multi-chain exposure simultaneously.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Bridge / cross-chain liquidity",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Shibarium's $1.7M permanent bridge loss at launch and Vitalik's dedicated post on cross-L2 wallet reads both highlight that moving assets between dozens of competing L2s remains structurally error-prone and recovery is often impossible.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity fragmentation",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Curve's deployment across all L2s combined generated only approximately $1,500 per day, prompting a governance proposal to cut L2 development entirely — concrete evidence that TVL spread across too many rollups collapses DeFi yield to economically unviable levels.",
