        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Blast launched with a single sequencer and heavy VC backing from Paradigm and Standard Crypto, while Ethereum R1 explicitly marketed itself against 'governance cults' and private sales, revealing that sequencer centralization and insider tokenomics remain the norm rather than the exception among new L2 launches.",
