        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Sony's Soneium L2 paired with a Sony Bank-issued JPY stablecoin introduces a licensed bank into the L2 stack, creating a regulated-entity dependency that differs structurally from permissionless rollups and may attract jurisdiction-specific oversight.",
